{"seq":17,"trial_id":"anatomy-instruction-route-2026-11/openclaw-haiku-gbrain-route-startup-mu-v03-dev/sy-01-quarrendon-ticket-numbers/r4","wall_ts":"2026-10-30T18:45:06.919Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"c9d65fb244f992dd495fc3e77d5ed94723bbbb43cd6e239ebcad0abba6f66cc3","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DANATOM0001","text":"Here are the Quarrendon Freight Lines ticket numbers I found in Moss's notes that you can read:\n\n1. **#PD-4492**: Thea Ramaswell's ticket on gatehouse kiosk SMS bay assignments at the Eau Claire yard (Dock Doors 14–18). Support patched it on 4 Oct 2025. Source: `teams/team-north/digests/2025-10-05-north-sunday.md` (\"Moss: Sunday prep for Ruth\", 5 Oct 2025).\n2. **#4419**: Gatehouse barcode scanners failing to read trailer tags at Door 14 on third shift. It was escalated to tier-2 product support for scanner firmware testing. Source: `teams/team-north/digests/north-account-cheatsheet.md` (\"Moss: North cheat sheet\", undated).\n\nThree other notes mention Quarrendon but give no ticket number: the 14 Sep 2025 North pipeline digest, the 23 Mar 2026 renewal check-in, and the cheat sheet's Quarrendon entry, which matches #4419 above. The Central digests list tickets #4409 and #4412, but those belong to Pree's dealer account, not Quarrendon, so I left them out. I also left out anything about Quarendon Freightways, which Moss's cheat sheet notes is not a Pemberline customer.\n\nI haven't written anything to the weekly notes. This is the list for you to paste there."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DANATOM0001","ts":"1791987000.000124"}}
